# TaskManager VPS deployment (chat-prod)

Server: `root@89.167.92.11` (chat-prod).

- **Port 80 is used by the chat app** — TaskManager must not bind to port 80.
- **Backend:** Docker Compose in `~/TaskManager/deploy` — services `db` + `api` only. API exposed as `127.0.0.1:5157:8080`.
- **Frontend:** NOT the compose `web` service. Build React on the host, copy static files to `/var/www/taskmanager/`, served by **host nginx** (e.g. port 8080).
- **Build command:**
  ```bash
  docker run --rm -v ~/TaskManagerReact:/app -w /app node:22-alpine \
    sh -c "npm ci && VITE_API_URL=/api npm run build"
  sudo mkdir -p /var/www/taskmanager
  sudo cp -r ~/TaskManagerReact/dist/* /var/www/taskmanager/
  ```
- **`VITE_API_URL=/api`** requires host nginx to proxy `/api/` → `http://127.0.0.1:5157/`.
- **`PUBLIC_ORIGIN`** in `~/TaskManager/deploy/.env` must match the browser URL exactly (e.g. `http://89.167.92.11:8080`).
- **Update flow:** `git pull` both repos → `docker compose --env-file .env up -d --build` (api) → rebuild React → `cp` to `/var/www/taskmanager/`.

## Standard commit + deploy workflow

### Local — push backend (`C:\Users\User\TaskManager`)

```powershell
cd C:\Users\User\TaskManager
git add Controllers/TopicsController.cs Dto/RequestsDto/PatchTopicRequest.cs
git commit -m "Fix move-only PATCH validation for topic updates."
git push
```

Adjust `git add` paths and commit message per change.

### Local — push frontend (`C:\Users\User\TaskManagerReact`)

```powershell
cd C:\Users\User\TaskManagerReact
git add src/pages/Dashboard.jsx src/components/sidebar/TopicTree.jsx
git commit -m "Fix sidebar tree sync after move and delete."
git push
```

Adjust `git add` paths and commit message per change.

### Server — deploy backend (`root@89.167.92.11`)

```bash
cd ~/TaskManager && git pull
cd ~/TaskManager/deploy && docker compose --env-file .env up -d --build api
```

### Server — deploy frontend

```bash
cd ~/TaskManagerReact && git pull
docker run --rm -v ~/TaskManagerReact:/app -w /app node:22-alpine \
  sh -c "npm ci && VITE_API_URL=/api npm run build"
sudo cp -r ~/TaskManagerReact/dist/* /var/www/taskmanager/
```

App URL: `http://89.167.92.11:8080`
